Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.22,0:00:47.81,Title,0,0,0,0,,《鬼娃回魂5：鬼娃孽种》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.13,0:02:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,日本制造\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made in Japan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.19,0:02:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我一生中见过最丑的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the ugliest thing I've ever seen in my whole life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.37,0:02:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实是 谁送的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It certainly is, Who sent it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.94,0:02:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,很奇怪 上面没想写 能是谁送的呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's strange, it doesn't say.Who could've come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.07,0:02:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢它 它老盯着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like it.It's staring at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.94,0:03:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是你叔叔的一个恶作剧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's probably one of your uncle's jokes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.25,0:03:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不认为这有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think it's funny at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.53,0:03:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我去洗个澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darling, I'm just going to have a shower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.12,0:03:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be there in a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.67,0:04:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳迪娅 我告诉过你别乱扔玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claudia, I told you not to leave your toys lying about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.94,0:04:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好家伙 你可真吓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good God! You are hideous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.46,0:04:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳迪娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claudia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.02,0:04:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.14,0:04:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可有言在先的 小丫头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a bone to pick you with you, young lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.42,0:04:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之前不是说好的吗？是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had an agreement, didn't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.90,0:04:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.98,0:04:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 老爸 我没有把它放在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Daddy, I didn't leave it there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.98,0:04:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,在文明社会里 说话要算话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a civilized society, our word is our bond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.30,0:04:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听不懂你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.50,0:05:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是你生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because it's your birthday, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.06,0:05:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你也不能为所欲为\N{\fnArial\fs30}that doesn't mean that you can relinquish all…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.14,0:05:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,理查德？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.38,0:05:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,理查德 什么声音？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richard, what was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.98,0:07:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了我的妈妈和爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed my mommy and daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.66,0:07:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你又尿裤子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you're pissing your pants!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.26,0:07:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你尿裤子了 你尿裤子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're pissing your pants! You're pissing your pants!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.10,0:07:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 你尿裤子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up! You're pissing your pants!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.26,0:07:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, ladies and gentlemen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.50,0:07:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们期待已久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}what you've all been waiting for{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.94,0:07:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,丑脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shitface!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.78,0:07:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有全英国最优秀的口技家…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the greatest ventriloquist in all of England:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.10,0:07:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯子伯塞斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The psychotic Psychs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.44,0:07:47.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（伯塞斯&丑脸）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.19,0:07:52.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（英国皇家国际口技大赛 格拉斯顿伯里 英格兰）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.94,0:08:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个令人生厌的小怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}This grotesque abomination…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.10,0:08:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在生理结构上有一些异常\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ain't even anatomically correct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.30,0:08:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,别笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't laugh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.82,0:08:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是病\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a serious condition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.98,0:08:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,六年前 我在州立公墓里发现了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six years ago, I found it in a cemetery back in the States.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.42,0:08:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小崽子试图扯破我的喉咙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little fucker tried to rip me throat out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.66,0:08:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时是想给你个拥抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to give you a hug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.82,0:08:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对自己知之甚少\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know much about myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.06,0:08:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道自己是个孤儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I'm an orphan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.14,0:08:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道自己是个怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I'm a freak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.82,0:08:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我还知道我是个日本货\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, of course, I know that I'm Japanese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.38,0:08:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是为何我会做那么可怕的梦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why do I have such terrible nightmares?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.50,0:08:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,充满着仇恨 血腥和内脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Filled with hate and blood and guts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.82,0:08:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一点都不喜欢这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not like that at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.70,0:08:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至都不会伤害一只苍蝇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't even hurt a fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.18,0:08:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 它飞走了 去找它的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there he goes, back to his family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.02,0:08:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 真让我羡慕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I envy him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.46,0:09:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时 我真想知道我父母是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I wonder about my own parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.06,0:09:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是禅宗大师吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were they Zen masters?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.22,0:09:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们祀奉天皇吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did they serve the emperor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.18,0:09:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 有时我真想知道我父母长什么样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sometimes I wonder what my mom and dad were really like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.02,0:09:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来 你不相信有圣诞老人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you don't believe in Santa Claus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.54,0:09:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 相信我 亲爱的 今晚我就会让你相信的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, trust me, honey, tonight I'm going to make you believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.86,0:09:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就等着瞧圣诞老人带什么给你吧 顽皮的小丫头\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wait and see what Santa is bringing you, you naughty girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.34,0:09:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我能听见你 你没断线\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can hear you fine. You're not breakin' up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.74,0:09:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑟艾拉 我刚才说你没有断线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheila, I just said you're not breakin' up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.26,0:09:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.18,0:09:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要和我分手？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're breaking up with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.14,0:09:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你他妈的在平安夜和我分手？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, you're breakin' up with me on Christmas Eve?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.98,0:09:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑟艾拉 你他妈的和我开玩笑吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheila, you have got to be fuckin' kidding me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.94,0:09:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑟艾拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheila!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.98,0:09:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 真他妈的爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's just great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.82,0:10:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.46,0:11:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.14,0:11:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是真心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.46,0:11:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直就不是真心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were never real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.46,0:11:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂那种失望的感觉么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what that kind of disappointment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.66,0:11:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,为人付出的感觉么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}can do to somebody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.50,0:11:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白那会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.26,0:11:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你下地狱的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}how that can fuck with your mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.46,0:11:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,下地狱吧 去死吧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck with your mind! Fuck with your mind!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.14,0:11:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的 去你妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck with your mind! Fuck with your mind!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.34,0:11:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妹你妹夫你全家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck with your mind!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.74,0:11:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰吉又出问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky is broke again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.66,0:11:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是血淋淋的谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is bloody ridiculous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.78,0:11:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,停 停 停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut! Cut! Cut!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.30,0:11:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,停止造雪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill the snow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.42,0:11:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.74,0:11:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤尼 刚才咋回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony, what was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.18,0:11:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 那只是 只是 .\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, it's… it's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.62,0:11:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太业余了 老子不干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is unprofessional, and I can't work like this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.18,0:11:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 杰森 很抱歉 杰森 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Jason, I'm sorry.No, Jason. Please wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.18,0:11:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现处好莱坞场地 现场正拍摄\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here in Hollywood, where production is underway{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.94,0:11:57.93,Title,0,0,0,0,,一部新恐怖大片《内心中恰吉》\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the new horror flick, Chucky Goes Psycho.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.02,0:12:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,影片讲述了恰吉和蒂凡尼的都市传奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}The film tells the urban legend of Chucky and Tiffany, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.14,0:12:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个娃娃充当连环杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}two dolls supposedly possessed by serial killers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.10,0:12:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个娃娃在戏里出现意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dolls were found at the scene{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.82,0:12:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,险酿真实谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a string of real-life murders{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.46,0:12:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,直至今日问题还没有解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}which remain unsolved to this day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.70,0:12:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计们 我想 呃 蒂凡尼的左臂又松了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you guys, I think, uh, Tiffany's left arm is loose again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.98,0:12:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 呃 我在找詹妮弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uh, I'm looking for Jennifer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.22,0:12:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人知道詹妮弗去哪了么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does anyone have a 20 on Jennifer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.58,0:12:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,去餐车里看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the catering truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.78,0:12:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.98,0:12:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗 我给你找了种减肥饮料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer.I got you a Skinny Quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.54,0:12:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.70,0:12:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰莉小姐 我们都在等你上镜呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Tilly, we're ready for you on set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.22,0:12:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗 我可真是服了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer, I am so proud of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.62,0:12:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.02,0:12:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还能照喝不误\N{\fnArial\fs30}For sticking to your diet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.94,0:12:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.10,0:12:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天有啥新闻？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on in the world today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.42,0:12:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,茱莉亚·罗伯特的下部片酬达到了2500万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julia Roberts is getting$25 million for her next film.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.42,0:13:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是茱莉亚·罗伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julia Roberts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.58,0:13:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个茱莉亚·罗伯特我都听烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so tired of hearing about Julia Roberts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.74,0:13:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 艾伦·布劳克伟什应该让我来演\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I should have played Erin Brockovich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.22,0:13:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不用加厚胸罩就能演好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have done it without a Wonderbra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.06,0:13:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,茱莉亚抢了我的那部分戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julia stole that part right out from under me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.38,0:13:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你知道 她怎么做的么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know how she did it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.74,0:13:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她和导演睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She slept with the director.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.94,0:13:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I think.{\r}
