Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.50,0:20:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,「醒醒」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Wake up"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.40,0:20:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.06,0:20:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,「苏醒吧」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Awake"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.94,0:21:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂凡尼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.50,0:21:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰吉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.02,0:21:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.86,0:21:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,丑脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shitface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.50,0:21:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 这算他妈的什么鸟名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what kind of a name is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.94,0:21:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你老妈和老爸呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are your mother and father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.46,0:21:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你那张脸 我猜他们都没脸见人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Judging from that face, my guess is they're hidin'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.30,0:21:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, you asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.26,0:21:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 看看吧 这孩子要多丑有多丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, come on. It looks like the kid hell off the ugly tree{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.66,0:22:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们全家一定也都这么丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hit every branch on the way down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.54,0:22:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 你该为你的父母感到自卑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you got to feel bad for the parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.98,0:22:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜他们也一定长这个丑样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder what they must look like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.58,0:22:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.62,0:22:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.36,0:22:30.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你们好 妈妈爸爸）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.54,0:22:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳尼？不\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.50,0:22:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们 呃 你没有 我们没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}We, uh…You didn't… We didn't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.82,0:22:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心肝 快来妈妈这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetface, come to Mommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.86,0:22:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这 .这怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's… What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.14,0:22:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.78,0:22:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在好莱坞\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Hollywood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.46,0:22:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在电视上看到你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you on the telly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.30,0:23:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰吉 恰吉 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky, Chucky, wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.66,0:23:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我们 我们成名了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at us. We've had makeovers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.94,0:23:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是影星了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're movie stars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.86,0:23:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 开启芭芘模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. Barbie mode.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.06,0:23:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他们就是娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they're puppets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.70,0:23:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会说话 也不会走路\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't walk and talk by themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.50,0:23:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 想要修好他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, if you want them to work, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.46,0:23:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就得拆了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to have to take them apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.94,0:23:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈病了么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Mommy ill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.06,0:23:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,道具师认为是病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The courts thought so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.94,0:24:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,抬起头来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.46,0:24:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们真的是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're stark raving mad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.62,0:24:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你尿裤子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you're pissin'your pants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.66,0:25:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰吉 她只是被吓到了而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky, she just had an accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.74,0:25:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说「他」被吓到了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, "he" had an accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.98,0:25:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,别盯着我看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.90,0:25:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧 我说过她是女孩的吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, what did I tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.18,0:25:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个漂亮的小丫头\N{\fnArial\fs30}A beautiful little girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.30,0:25:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？你瞎了？是个小男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Are you blind? That's my boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.94,0:25:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.34,0:25:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是小鸡鸡还没发育好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just hasn't had his growth spurt, yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.82,0:25:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子 别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about it, Son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.94,0:25:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发育的有点晚 就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a late bloomer, that's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.34,0:25:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在关键是你得有个真正的名字了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's high time that you had a real name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.30,0:25:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.30,0:25:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为我们就叫你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm going to call you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.74,0:25:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,格林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.02,0:25:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,格林？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.26,0:25:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,女孩儿起这名字哪行？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of a name is that for a girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.90,0:25:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 别听他的 从现在开始 你的名字就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't listen to him, honey. From now on, your name is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.86,0:26:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,格琳达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.70,0:26:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 格琳达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run, Glenda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.78,0:26:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 真够乱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeez, what a mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.14,0:26:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.74,0:26:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这了 巧克力先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are, Mr. Goodbar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.50,0:26:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗·泰莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer Tilly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.42,0:27:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.70,0:27:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.50,0:27:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊 你可真逼真\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. You look so real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.98,0:27:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,真够逼真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look so real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.74,0:27:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比我前男友还要可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are cuter than my last boyfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.30,0:27:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们真是可爱的一对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we make a lovely couple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.82,0:27:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗 泰莉小姐 你和他有什么过节么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer. Miss Tilly, were you having an affair with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.90,0:27:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不懂你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.66,0:27:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是皮特 名人访谈栏目组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete Peters, Celebrities Revealed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.14,0:27:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗 你刚才看到什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer, what did you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.50,0:27:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,操 难道你让我给你画下来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you want me to draw you a picture?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.30,0:27:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能画么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.42,0:27:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁递过来一张纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody give her a piece of paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.90,0:27:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不会给你画出来的 好不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm not gonna draw you a picture, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.90,0:28:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 别这么沮丧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't feel bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.22,0:28:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是一个演员 不是艺术家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an actress not an artist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.66,0:28:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你看到尸体的时候你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you doin' when you sawthe body?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.90,0:28:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,无可奉告\N{\fnArial\fs30}No comment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.50,0:28:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer, I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.10,0:28:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer, I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.02,0:28:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和「红男」真的谈过话么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true that you and Redman are in talks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.22,0:28:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于出演他的新片子的事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}about you starring in his new movie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.10,0:28:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 事实上 是这样的 我已经\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. As a matter of fact, that is true. I have…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.66,0:28:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,能签个名么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I have your autograph?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.86,0:28:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.70,0:28:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 等等 你们忘记脑袋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hold on, you forgot the head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.58,0:28:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 让一让 借过一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Excuse me. Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.86,0:28:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗 你实际年龄多大？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer, how old are you really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.74,0:28:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的狗仔队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paparazzi scumbag!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.86,0:28:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是哪一年出生的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What year were you born?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.38,0:28:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我们一个确切的日期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us the exact date.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.58,0:28:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要和你一起坐在前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to sit up front with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.02,0:28:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.22,0:28:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在逃避什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you hiding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.66,0:28:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你还好么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.54,0:28:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 现在非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I am now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.78,0:29:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们驰骋在林荫路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}* We're on the boulevard *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.94,0:29:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我车里尽情的兜着风\N{\fnArial\fs30}* We're cruisin' in my car *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.78,0:29:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着人们转身向我们聚焦\N{\fnArial\fs30}* See all the fellows turn to look and see *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.06,0:29:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你们是一对忍者杀手？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, are you a pair of ninja assassins?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.42,0:29:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.86,0:29:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为日本黑帮卖命杀人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you hit men for the yakuza?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.38,0:29:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是日本人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not from Japan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.06,0:29:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是新泽西人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're from Jersey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.10,0:29:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想吧 詹妮弗·泰莉在电影里扮演我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just think, Jennifer Tilly is playing me in a movie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.42,0:29:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是多么完美的演绎\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's absolutely perfect casting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.82,0:29:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那只是配音\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that voice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.42,0:29:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 他的声线犹如天使般动人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, she sounds just like an angel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.06,0:29:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我全都计划好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I've got it all figured out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.42,0:29:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把我的灵魂化身为詹妮弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to transfer my soul into Jennifer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.82,0:29:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把你的灵魂化身为「红男」\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're going to transfer your soul into Redman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.58,0:29:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这主意真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm down with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.02,0:29:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们借他们的身体玩一次就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll ditch these plastic bodies once and for all, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.74,0:29:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们将成为好莱坞最红的一对\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll be Hollywood's hottest couple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.26,0:29:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.62,0:29:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 格琳达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, Glenda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.10,0:29:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也帮你计划好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got that figured out, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.10,0:30:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你长大后会真的成为一个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to be a real live girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.30,0:30:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.46,0:30:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.50,0:30:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我不能再怀孕了 我一直都这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm not getting pregnant again, I'll tell you that much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.30,0:30:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈以前一直告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother always told me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.10,0:30:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,说一次是祝福 说两次是诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once is a blessing. Twice is a curse.!!{\r}
