Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.30,0:47:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伯特·贝利的遗孀？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The widow of Robert Bailey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.14,0:47:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Who is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.34,0:47:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝利夫人 我的名字叫蒂凡尼·蕾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Bailey, my name is Tiffany Ray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.46,0:47:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 你不认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Urn, you don't know me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.10,0:47:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是在几年前 我杀了你的丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}but a few years ago, I killed your husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.50,0:47:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我致以真诚的歉意\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am so very, very sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.98,0:47:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么呢 恶作剧玩笑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this, some kind of sick joke?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.26,0:48:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不 我真的是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, I'm completely serious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.62,0:48:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你要知道 我现在正在忏悔呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I want you to know I'm in recovery now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.30,0:48:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我会试图把一切都忘掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I have put all of that behind me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.70,0:48:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who you are…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.18,0:48:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 贝利夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mrs. Bailey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.02,0:48:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a nice day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.46,0:48:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel better already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.26,0:48:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 斯坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, Stan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.26,0:48:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你不是有重要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wasn't there something important{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.22,0:48:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,要和我说么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}you wanted to tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.58,0:48:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.82,0:48:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情就是 詹妮弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}the thing is, Jennifer…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.66,0:48:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.42,0:48:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what's gotten into me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.10,0:48:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 那么你想说的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Urn, so you were saying…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.10,0:49:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.78,0:49:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.06,0:49:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 让我们想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, let's see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.38,0:49:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今天要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What should we do today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.30,0:49:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pregnant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.98,0:49:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,「红哥哥」 我说我怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red man, I said I'm pregnant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.94,0:49:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.18,0:49:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子他爹是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is the baby's daddy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.54,0:49:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,别盯着我看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't even look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.78,0:49:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 最近为了事业发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I haven't slept with anyone else{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.54,0:49:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没和其他人睡过\N{\fnArial\fs30}to advance my career lately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.54,0:49:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真逗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you kidding{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.90,0:49:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的 红男 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true, Red man. Look, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.38,0:50:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我看上去像个荡妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I come off all slutty, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.30,0:50:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那是 那是 在我看来 那只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that's…that's…for my image. It's just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.10,0:50:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道大家都怎么看待我么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think anyone would cast me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.98,0:50:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个肮脏的交际圈里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In these sexpot roles, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.14,0:50:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道我一年都没有做过爱么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}if they knew I hadn't been laid in a year?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.46,0:50:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至都没有和我的司机做过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't even slept with my driver yet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.14,0:50:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他真的非常喜欢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I think he really likes me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.22,0:50:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 这可真他妈的感人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, that's all very touchin' and shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.10,0:50:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我告诉你 肯定不可能是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm telling you, it can't be me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.58,0:50:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.86,0:50:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一到好莱坞就坐了输精管结扎术\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a vasectomy as soon as I got to Hollywood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.18,0:50:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不是傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't no idiot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.38,0:50:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那么 那就不可能了 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, that's impossible. I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.58,0:50:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 詹妮弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Jennifer, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.62,0:50:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想伤你的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to break itto you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.02,0:50:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果你怀孕了 就别想拍我的戏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't hire you if you're pregnant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.94,0:50:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那太可笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is ridiculous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.66,0:50:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,演员是个孕妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}The character is pregnant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.38,0:50:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.90,0:50:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我非常想要个特别的圣母玛利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I have a very specific vision of Mary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.34,0:50:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what can I say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.74,0:50:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一定会大红大紫\N{\fnArial\fs30}She gots to be hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.62,0:50:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That pig!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.74,0:51:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,戒毒康复热线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recovery Hotline.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.26,0:51:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我正在戒毒康复期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm in recovery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.54,0:51:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而我现在很担心我就要犯错误了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm afraid I'm going to have a slip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.54,0:51:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,能出来见见面么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you get to a meeting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.22,0:51:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这个倒没必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's really not an option.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.22,0:51:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只不过是让大家都吓到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just freak everybody out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.02,0:51:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要太这么自责\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be so hard on yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.42,0:51:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们又不会给你判刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not here to judge you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.70,0:51:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.82,0:51:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂凡尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiffany.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.90,0:51:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 蒂凡尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me, Tiffany.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.22,0:51:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很清楚你该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know exactly what you are going through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.58,0:51:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.70,0:51:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我…我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I… I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.78,0:51:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 我要和你分享一个小秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I'm gonna let you in on a little secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.42,0:51:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在上周 我也犯错误了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just last week, I had a slip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.90,0:51:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.02,0:51:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.10,0:51:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我也并非完人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And believe you me, it was not pretty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.46,0:51:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来就没有完美的人 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It never is, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.42,0:51:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我花了三个小时才收拾干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, it took me 3 hours just to clean up the mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.14,0:51:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊 别这么提醒我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, don't remind me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.78,0:51:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我并没有对此而感到内疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not beating myself up over it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.94,0:52:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道为什么吗 蒂凡尼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why, Tiffany?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.10,0:52:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.38,0:52:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为冰冻三尺非一日之寒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because Rome wasn't built in a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.42,0:52:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.74,0:52:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的太对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are absolutely right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.82,0:52:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Speaking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.98,0:52:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, who's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.30,0:52:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.62,0:52:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.82,0:52:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是不知道你是怎么搞到我的电话号码的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't know how you got my phone number.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.58,0:52:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这是私人专线 非公开性的号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it is a private, unlisted phone number.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.86,0:52:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得·皮特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete Peters?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.50,0:52:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我昨天见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I saw him yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.62,0:52:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我和他没有任何关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't have any relationship with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.26,0:52:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是个破狗仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is a firking paparazzi{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.82,0:52:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个总想给我拍照的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is trying to get pictures of me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.46,0:52:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷拍的或者正式的\N{\fnArial\fs30}in compromising positions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.46,0:52:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我现在和「红男」在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm with Redman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.82,0:52:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,「红男」 他是个导演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Redman, he's a director.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.42,0:52:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是 他也是个说唱歌手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Well, he's a rapper, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.22,0:52:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是说唱歌手兼导演 行了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is a rapper-director, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.22,0:53:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,转行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a hyphenate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.34,0:53:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye-bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.58,0:53:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.50,0:53:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 我在打电话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind? I'm on the phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.66,0:53:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,又有一起凶杀案了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been another murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.94,0:53:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？不 我告诉过你我当时在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No, I told you where I was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.18,0:53:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一整晚都和「红男」在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was right here all night with Redman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.38,0:53:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I don't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.86,0:53:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在别告诉我 我是嫌疑犯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not telling me I'm a suspect?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.42,0:53:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.02,0:53:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.46,0:53:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上要出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm leaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.78,0:53:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can let yourself out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.02,0:53:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺带一句 「红男」你去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, Redman, drop dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.30,0:53:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 格琳达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Glenda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.42,0:54:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,格琳达 亲爱的 一切都会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenda, honey. Everything is okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.70,0:54:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是犯了一个小错误而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just a little slip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.98,0:54:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有必要和你老爸说\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no need to tell your daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.26,0:54:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,保住我们之间的小秘密 好不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be our little secret, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.50,0:54:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好不？嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Shh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.58,0:54:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于圣昆丁监狱来说 今天是个大日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's D-day here at San Quentin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.98,0:54:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个从来都不敢想的人来到了这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would have thought it would ever come to this?{\r}
