Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.38,0:57:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a girl!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.06,0:57:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要个男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.66,0:57:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们快把我弄崩溃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are tearing me apart!{\r}
