Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.18,0:58:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 此话怎讲？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, which is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.18,0:58:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.58,0:58:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时感觉自己是个男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I feel like a boy.{\r}
