Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.70,0:58:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 没门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-uh!No way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.78,0:58:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有一件事我非常确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}But one thing I do know for sure.{\r}
