Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.66,0:58:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,格琳达 格林 管他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenda. Glen. Whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.98,0:58:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真为你感到自豪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so proud of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.18,0:58:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what happens, {\r}
