Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.86,0:59:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.38,0:59:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well, well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.02,0:59:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来高尚圣洁女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like Miss High and Mighty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.98,0:59:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是如此圣洁和高尚\N{\fnArial\fs30}ain't so perfect after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.06,0:59:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,犯了一个小错而已嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just a little slip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.98,0:59:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马也不是一天建成的 你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rome wasn't built in a day, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.26,0:59:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 这混蛋也真的该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, the fucker really had it coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.74,0:59:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那我的肉体躯壳怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what about my body?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.42,0:59:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会搞定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take care of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.70,1:00:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗 我爱你 詹妮弗 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer, I love you. Jennifer, I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.54,1:00:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.94,1:00:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我是斯坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Stan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.90,1:00:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我是詹妮弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, it's Jennifer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.94,1:00:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯坦 宝贝 我需要你的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stan, baby, I need your body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.94,1:00:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.46,1:00:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗 如果我遭遇不测\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer, if anything happens to me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.14,1:00:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.98,1:00:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们真是天造地设的一对\N{\fnArial\fs30}They really do make a cute couple, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.02,1:00:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.10,1:00:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我老妈一直说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like my mother always said…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.66,1:00:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.02,1:00:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你老妈说的够多的了 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough with your mother, already!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.98,1:00:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我20年前就已经杀了那个贱货\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed that bitch 20 years ago{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.78,1:00:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在她仍然还没有闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she still won't shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.62,1:00:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了 不会太久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, there. It won't be long now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.82,1:01:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.02,1:01:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.38,1:01:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在外面？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.62,1:01:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.78,1:01:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个碎嘴贱人 琼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's that nosy bitch, Joan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.18,1:01:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去搞定她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take care of her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.22,1:01:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't want you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.66,1:01:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁掉你那牛逼闪闪的高风亮节\N{\fnArial\fs30}to violate your delicate sensibilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.50,1:01:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.47,1:01:48.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（警报启动 报警）
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.18,1:01:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.10,1:02:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.02,1:02:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.82,1:02:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.10,1:03:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.94,1:03:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心你的背后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out behind you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.10,1:03:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.50,1:03:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.46,1:03:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.46,1:03:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不会责怪你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm not going to give you crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.82,1:03:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,人无完人 蒂凡尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody is perfect, Tiff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.58,1:03:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己也在壁橱里藏了些尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a few skeletons in the closet myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.42,1:03:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.14,1:03:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 好了 蒂凡尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, come on, Tiff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.62,1:03:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马建成需要多长时间 管他呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long did it take to build Rome, anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.66,1:03:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂凡尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.66,1:03:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,格林？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.98,1:04:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,在猜一次 老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess again, Daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.90,1:04:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,格琳达？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.58,1:04:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是我的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.18,1:04:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你不喜欢吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you wear it out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.74,1:04:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.94,1:04:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错过了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I miss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.42,1:04:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 没啥 我刚刚烧死了琼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, nothing much. I just fired Joan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.74,1:04:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来最后还是你赢了 蒂凡尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you win after all, Tiff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.26,1:04:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.18,1:04:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你俩都赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you both win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.14,1:04:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的是一位少女杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a real lady-killer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.18,1:04:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们懂我的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you catch my drift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.18,1:04:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一个无知的小丫头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a bona fide bonus baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.18,1:04:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天啊 恰吉 你对他做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ, Chucky, what did you do to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.74,1:04:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.98,1:04:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.06,1:04:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我起码陪孩子一起玩过\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least I spent time with the kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.38,1:04:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,格林 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glen, wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.70,1:04:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,消停会儿吧 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it, Mommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.34,1:04:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会把我的裙子弄皱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll wrinkle my dress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.86,1:04:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你喜欢吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and how do you like it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.86,1:05:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made it myseif.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.54,1:05:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有其母 必有其女 对不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like mother, like daughter, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.06,1:05:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有其母 必有其女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like mother, like daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.86,1:05:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了吗？母女 母女 母女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it? "Mother and daughter."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.50,1:05:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 醒醒 快醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, wake up! Right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.30,1:05:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,老妈？老爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom? Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.74,1:05:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.94,1:05:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,用力 泰莉小姐 用力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push, Miss Tilly. Push.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.26,1:05:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在用力 你这个混蛋小魔星\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am pushing, you little star-fucker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.02,1:06:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,别在意这位脏话连篇妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pay no attention to little Miss Potty Mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.58,1:06:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's hormonal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.18,1:06:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 要出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God. It's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.98,1:06:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都能看到他的小脑袋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see its little head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.22,1:06:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,男孩女孩？男孩女孩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.78,1:06:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.94,1:06:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,男孩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.34,1:06:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.18,1:06:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,把孩子给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me my baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.50,1:06:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想看看我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want my baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.46,1:06:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰吉 恰吉 呃 还没生完呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky, Chucky, uh, well, we're not done here yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.30,1:06:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.46,1:06:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗还没有生完呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer isn't done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.70,1:06:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个小宝宝没出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got another one here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.26,1:06:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,用力 詹妮弗 用力 用力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push, Jennifer! Push! Push, push.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.50,1:07:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它挤出来 挤出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push it out! Push!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.34,1:07:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.82,1:07:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.50,1:07:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Groovy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.82,1:07:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 呀 呀 呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ai, yai, yai, yai, yai.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.78,1:07:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰吉 是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky, it's time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.56,1:07:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.94,1:07:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我祈求你 赐予我力量吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the power, I beg of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.98,1:07:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰吉 他必须得选一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky, first he has to choose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.94,1:07:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg your pardon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.14,1:07:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 她必须得选一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. She has to choose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.54,1:07:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间管这屁事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have time for this shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.10,1:07:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 恰吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, Chucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.78,1:07:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在有了一个儿子和一个女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a son and a daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.38,1:07:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,格林和格琳达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glen and Glenda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.74,1:07:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you get it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.34,1:07:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许神明都用不着筛选了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they don't have to choose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.30,1:07:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.98,1:07:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 恰吉 快念咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry, Chucky! Do the chant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.10,1:08:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰吉 快点念咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky, do it now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.26,1:08:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.82,1:08:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰吉 你傻站着那干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky, what are you standing there for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.70,1:08:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,念咒语啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do the chant!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.98,1:08:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,还等什么呢？快点念咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you waiting for? Do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.70,1:08:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,念咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do the chant!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.06,1:08:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,念啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.14,1:08:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,都给我统统 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody just shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.38,1:08:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受够了 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have had it! That's it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.06,1:08:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们时间有限\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a limit to how much I can take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.90,1:08:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.78,1:08:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你的周围 蒂凡尼 这太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look around you, Tiff. This is nuts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.14,1:08:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很能容忍你这些疯狂举动\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have a very high tolerance for nuts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.70,1:08:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这只是会让我们成为人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this is what it takes to be human, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.02,1:08:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我宁可选择我的机遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I would rather take my chances{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.06,1:08:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为一个天生疯狂的超级娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a supernaturally possessed doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.06,1:08:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,可比成为人类简单的多\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's less complicated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.78,1:08:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会是认真的吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be serious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.42,1:08:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是发自内心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a heart attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.30,1:08:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.46,1:08:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为人类有什么好的 各方面？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is so great about being human, anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.42,1:08:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会生病 你会衰老\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get sick. You get old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.06,1:08:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后爬都爬不起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't get it up anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.26,1:08:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不期待成为那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not looking forward to that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.46,1:09:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我只是想成为詹妮弗·泰莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I want to be Jennifer Tilly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.66,1:09:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想成为明星\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to be a star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.66,1:09:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我不想成为你的司机\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't want to be your chauffeur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.38,1:09:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为一个娃娃 我他妈的声名狼藉\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a doll, I'm fucking infamous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.70,1:09:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是历史上最富盛名的杀手之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm one of the most notorious slashers in history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.38,1:09:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而我不想放弃这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't want to give that up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.30,1:09:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是恰吉 王牌的娃娃杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Chucky, the killer doll!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.70,1:09:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I dig it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.94,1:09:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有我想要的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have everything I want:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.06,1:09:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位漂亮的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A beautiful wife, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.30,1:09:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个天生丽质的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}a multi-talented kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.46,1:09:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是真正的我 蒂凡尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is who I am, Tiff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.66,1:09:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.02,1:09:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰吉 我不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky, I don't know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.86,1:09:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的在说些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what the fuck you're talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.34,1:09:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道你他妈的到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who the fuck you are anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.14,1:09:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是对于我来说还不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's not enough for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.78,1:09:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要的更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.18,1:09:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you sayin'?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.14,1:09:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.86,1:09:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先出去 小心肝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to get out of here, Sweetface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.38,1:10:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要离开你 恰吉 我要带走孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm leaving you, Chucky, and I'm taking the kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.02,1:10:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人能离开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody leaves me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.14,1:10:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.82,1:10:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.54,1:10:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.42,1:10:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.10,1:10:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯坦 说出来 说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stan, tell me. Tell me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.78,1:10:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.86,1:10:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.78,1:10:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.90,1:10:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.74,1:11:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孩子 把孩子给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My babies. Give me my babies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.66,1:11:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想知道他们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to know where they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.62,1:11:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很好 詹妮弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're fine, Jennifer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.74,1:11:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都在婴儿护理室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in the maternity ward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.10,1:11:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 有那么难吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, was that so hard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.38,1:11:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在最重要的是你要好好恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}The important thing to think about now is getting well{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.94,1:11:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样你才能继续你的生活和事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you can get on with your life and your career.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.30,1:11:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不关心我的事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care about my career.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.50,1:11:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want my babies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.62,1:11:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在办这件事 詹妮弗 但是不是那么容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm working on it, Jennifer, but you're not making it easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.30,1:11:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经和警察谈过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already talked to the cops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.78,1:11:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们释放我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They cleared me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.90,1:11:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道你是清白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know you're not a killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.42,1:11:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是没说你是头脑清醒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't say you were mentally competent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.78,1:11:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别指望着 他们会相信你讲的那个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what do you expect, after the story you told them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.66,1:11:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.34,1:11:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 好吧 我建议你从现在开始什么也别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I suggest from now on you keep that to yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.78,1:11:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.10,1:11:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们过会儿在谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll talk later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.54,1:11:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡会觉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to get some sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.94,1:13:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝我好运吧 小心肝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish me luck, Sweetface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.98,1:13:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈就要成为明星了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy is going to be a star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.74,1:13:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我简直无话可说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't think of a thing to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.70,1:13:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.24,1:13:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.06,1:13:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我祈求你 赐予我力量吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the power, I beg of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.00,1:13:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.38,1:13:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,移魂 移魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switch! Switch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.06,1:13:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,移魂 移魂 移魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switch! Switch! Switch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.66,1:13:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人能离开我 没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody leaves me. Nobody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.18,1:14:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okasan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.26,1:14:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你成为一个好女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to be a good girl{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.94,1:14:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者男孩 什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}or boy. Whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.70,1:14:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再重蹈你爸爸和妈妈的覆辙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make the same mistakes your mom and dad made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.30,1:14:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是你爸爸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially your dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.58,1:14:46.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（谢谢你 妈妈）
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.62,1:15:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.78,1:15:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,格琳达？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.90,1:15:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 老爸 是我 你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dad! It's me! Your boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.66,1:15:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,送您归西的好儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your chip off the old block!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.02,1:15:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在为我自豪吧 老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you proud of me now, Daddy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.54,1:15:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,自豪吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.54,1:16:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好儿子 孩子 真是好儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attaboy, kid. Attaboy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.06,1:16:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.94,1:16:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.54,1:16:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.18,1:16:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.74,1:16:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.74,1:16:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.18,1:16:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.22,1:17:11.73,Note,0,0,0,0,,（五年后）
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.46,1:17:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天 她把达纳·谢尔顿的鼻子弄出血了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday, she gave Dana Shelton a bloody nose{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.46,1:17:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后还照了照片四处张扬\N{\fnArial\fs30}and took pictures of it for Show and Tell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.78,1:17:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她给那只猫取了个脏话名字（Cock：男人生殖器）\N{\fnArial\fs30}She called the cat the "C" word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.82,1:17:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我十分肯定她从我包里偷过钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm pretty sure she's been taking money from my purse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.78,1:17:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,太滑稽了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's ridiculous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.98,1:17:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,格林 他是个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glen, he is an angel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.46,1:17:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有家长的梦想\N{\fnArial\fs30}An absolute dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.94,1:17:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是格琳达\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Glenda, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.74,1:17:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个坏女孩 泰莉小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's a bad girl, Miss Tilly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.34,1:17:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个非常坏的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}A very bad girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.82,1:17:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想听这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not listening to this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.86,1:17:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我讨厌这个东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I hate that thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.26,1:17:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是许多孩子真的很想见见她呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of the kids really want to see her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.06,1:17:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰莉小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Tilly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.14,1:17:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.22,1:17:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怕她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid of her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.54,1:17:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 弗维娅 一个娃娃而已嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Fulvia, it's only a doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.02,1:17:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在说格琳达\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was talking about Glenda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.26,1:18:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗维娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fulvia, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.14,1:18:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,能把你的话说的直白点吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}just exactly what are you trying to say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.90,1:18:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能在这干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't work here anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.78,1:18:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.94,1:18:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 就是不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I just can't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.18,1:18:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以看看她看我的眼神里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you only saw the way she looks at me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.66,1:18:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,充满了仇恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}with such hate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.74,1:18:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 弗维娅 如果你想这样做的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Fulvia, if that's what you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.62,1:18:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会想念你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll miss you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.42,1:18:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 泰莉小姐 愿上帝保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Miss Tilly. God bless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.62,1:18:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.82,1:18:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,保佑你妹啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God bless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.06,1:19:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,犯个小错而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a little slip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.74,1:19:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马也不是一天建成的 你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rome wasn't built in a day, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.18,1:19:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都会遇到一些小挫折\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all have our little setbacks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.06,1:19:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是一个坏人 只不过是做点坏事而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a bad person. I just do bad things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.14,1:19:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shs…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.70,1:20:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈终于如愿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom got her wish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.46,1:20:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在是一颗耀眼的明星\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a bright shining star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.42,1:20:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们的家庭很完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we're the perfect family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.54,1:20:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己也学会了很多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've learned a lot about myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.90,1:20:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我并不孤独\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I'm not alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.66,1:20:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,也知道我并不是怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I'm not a freak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.94,1:20:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我们还是有一些不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}And even though we had our differences, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.62,1:20:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道爸爸真的很爱我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know my dad really loved me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.62,1:20:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 格林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Glen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.74,1:20:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,格林 小心肝 来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glen, sweetheart, come over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.14,1:20:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这 小心肝 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, sweetheart, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.54,1:20:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还有件礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's another one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.34,1:20:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁送的 妈妈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is it from, Mommy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.74,1:20:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.66,1:20:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 看看吧 哦 上面没有写\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, let's see. Oh, it doesn't say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.66,1:20:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好奇怪 上面没说是谁送的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange. It doesn't say who it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.98,1:20:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜 心肝 别跑的太远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, sweetheart. Don't run so fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.90,1:20:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,等会还要出发去旅游的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to trip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.10,1:20:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便吧 他自己都决定好了何时出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}So anyway, he determined that he was going to go off…{\r}
